# SEL = PITCH MOD (view 11): shape, amount, rate of the selected track. No more "this screen as a list".
wait 300
tap FX
expect view 9
tap SEL
expect view 11
shot pmod_idle.png
turn K2 10 80
shot pmod_amount.png
wait 1000
turn K1 4 80
wait 3000
shot pmod_sin.png
turn K1 4 80
wait 3000
shot pmod_rnd.png
turn K3 5 80
shot pmod_rate.png
# SEL again: stays on PITCH MOD (no list opens)
tap SEL
expect view 11
shot pmod_again.png
# wip82: K1 turned = the zoom is the CIRCLE (icon + MOD MODE + the mode name), K2 = MOD AMT in sm
wait 3000
turn K1 4 80
shot pmod_zoom_k1.png
wait 3000
turn K2 10 80
shot pmod_zoom_k2.png
